  "reasoning": "The claim was denied with PR-204 (service not covered) and the patient's eligibility has lapsed, meaning the payer will not pay the allowed amount. Since the patient is the subscriber and the remaining balance equals the deductible, the contractual responsibility falls entirely on the patient. Billing the patient is the only action that can recover the funds, as resubmission or appeal is futile against a coverage denial with lapsed eligibility.",
  "action": "bill_patient"
